.git
.gitignore
.cursor
.claude
.venv
venv
env
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.so
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
tests/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
# Source modules. Each module's README.md is package metadata its build needs, and module tests stay out.
modules/*/tests/
!modules/*/README.md
# Never-released members (check_release.NEVER_RELEASED_MODULES), last: the rule that matches last wins,
# and a README re-included above would leave a member directory without its pyproject.toml, which uv
# refuses ("Workspace member ... is missing a pyproject.toml").
modules/reference/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
